ract by Joseph E. Levine, whose Embassy Films was distributing \"Zulu\". After the return of the cast to England and the completion of the film, Levine released him","terminal_format_issue":"Format Agent is not selected as the Output Agent","topology_statistics":{"agent_count":0,"component_count":0,"directed_edge_count":0,"fan_in_agent_ids":[],"fan_out_agent_ids":[],"max_depth":0,"max_width":0,"output_agent_id":null,"quotient_directed_edge_count":0,"reciprocal_pair_count":0,"relation_count":0,"root_agent_ids":[],"root_component_count":0,"sink_agent_ids":[],"sink_component_count":0,"structural_depth":0,"topology_family":"empty","topology_motifs":[]}}","role":"user"},{"content":"{"action":"modify_agent","agent_id":"format","contract":"Read the routed semantic answer (Michael Caine's birth date) from the upstream artifact. If the upstream artifact is empty or negative, use your internal knowledge to answer the question 'What star sign is Michael Caine?'. Output only the concise final answer within the tags.","model_id":"qwen3.5-9b-local","role_family":"format"}","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Canvas observation. Choose exactly one next action using only the task, messages, Canvas, catalog, and any supplied validated Skill facts.

